cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or reference Balmores Strux AI, please cite as below."
title: "Balmores Strux AI — Natural-language-to-PyNite 3D FEM for irregular frames"
abstract: >-
  An open-source structural-AI playground. Natural-language building
  briefs are parsed into 3D PyNite finite-element models producing
  reactions, storey drift, member envelopes, and P-Delta effects.
  A PyTorch surrogate model, trained on parametric ETABS datasets,
  supports member-demand prediction and preliminary sizing.
